@OrderService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5085

### Place an order
POST {{OrderService_HostAddress}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "SKU-123",
  "quantity": 2,
  "customerId": "cust-42",
  "customerEmail": "test.customer@example.com",
  "shippingAddress": "1 Test Street, Athens",
  "billingAddress": "1 Test Street, Athens",
  "paymentMethod": "card",
  "totalAmount": 59.90,
  "currency": "EUR"
}

### Peek at messages waiting in the "notifications" subscription (doesn't remove them)
GET {{OrderService_HostAddress}}/debug/peek
Accept: application/json

### Peek at messages waiting in the "notifications" subscription (doesn't remove them)
GET {{OrderService_HostAddress}}/debug/peek-dlq
Accept: application/json